# 统一换行符：文本文件一律 LF，二进制文件不做转换
# 作用：覆盖 core.autocrlf=true 的行为，消除
# "warning: LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it"
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源（禁止 EOL/diff 处理）
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.m4a binary
*.flac binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
